---
const platforms = ["iOS", "iPadOS", "watchOS", "tvOS", "UI design"];
---

<section id="about" class="border-y border-line-soft bg-surface">
  <div class="wrap flex flex-wrap gap-x-20 gap-y-8 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <h2 class="flex-[1_1_17.5rem] font-display text-[clamp(1.875rem,3vw,2.5rem)] leading-[1.1] font-bold tracking-[-0.02em]">
      From the first sketch to the App Store.
    </h2>
    <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-[999_1_32.5rem] flex-col gap-5 text-lg/[1.6] text-fg-body sm:text-[1.1875rem]/[1.6]">
      <p>
        I can design your app, build it and ship it, or just help with the part you need. My code is clear and well
        tested, so your team can easily take it over.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can find my full work history on{" "}
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ephread/"
          class="text-teal underline underline-offset-3 hover:text-teal-dark"
        >
          LinkedIn
        </a>
        , and my past open source work on{" "}
        <a href="https://github.com/ephread" class="text-teal underline underline-offset-3 hover:text-teal-dark">
          GitHub
        </a>
        .
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2" aria-label="Platforms and skills">
        {platforms.map((platform) => (
          <li class="rounded-full border border-line bg-beige px-3.5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-fg">{platform}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
